 @jmanculy1  I'm just making suggestions for a hero worth looking up to mate, not trying to be mean to you. Hollywood types seldom posses qualities worth looking up to, I've learnt the hard way over the years. Now I prefer to not know anything about actors because they're generally pretty scummy people in real life bar a few exceptions. Will is not an exception unfortunately. Don't confuse his acting roles with who he is, I like some of his characters but as a person there isn't much I like about him.

I've listed two heroic people already, Chuck Yeager would be another great man worthy of admiration for his quality of character in the air and on the ground. A great female hero would be Margaret Hamilton, she changed the course of our world, pun intended.

